Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總算恢復原樣了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:16.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始果然還是有頭髮比較帥\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你還真敢說啊 真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多快入秋了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:34.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好久沒來迷宮市集了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:36.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 這個時期正忙呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以一直抽不出空來逛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.41,0:00:45.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛的墜子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這個真不錯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:50.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是有點貴啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老闆 這個給我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:56.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:00:58.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要直接戴 盒子另外給我就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:07.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不… 不不 這種東西我不能收\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:09.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,平常也受你照顧不少\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:11.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很適合你啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:14.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生真會拈花惹草\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:19.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就讓我揉一下胸部吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:21.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,低級！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:30.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次收到男人禮物…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.09,0:01:34.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事 突然一陣惡寒\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:42.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那樣啦 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:46.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:49.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也想要禮物\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:52.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的… 拿你沒辦法\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:59.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是愛吃肉嗎？別客氣\n儘管吃吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:04.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦！始你這個笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:26.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第11話 魅惑的力量）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:40.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:44.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以莉露才會這麼不高興啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.05,0:03:47.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露想讓始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把我當成女孩子看待\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可得好好培養出女人味才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:57.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把身體洗乾淨就可以了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那個意思…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:00.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是像我這樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:03.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,努力讓自己變漂亮！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:05.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要成為漂亮的女人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:07.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,男人就會連寶石都獻給你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:10.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是始又沒送大姊姊東西啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:14.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是大姊姊不漂亮嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊 那個大笨蛋就是這樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:20.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明明身邊就有我這麼\n漂亮的青梅竹馬\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他到底在想什麼啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話是這麼說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:29.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但要靠魅魔的力量總覺得太卑鄙了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:34.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我是說魅惑魔眼喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:37.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,用這個力量的話\n要人送多少東西都行…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:43.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過那只是暫時的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總覺得像是輸了一樣吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:50.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是始沒辦法超喜歡莉露的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:51.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露可能就會用了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 你很激進耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:54.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎樣才能用魅惑之力啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:05:02.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,魅惑之力每個個體都有差異\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也只能等它覺醒了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你遲早會有辦法用的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來 打起精神！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:16.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明天我給你點好東西！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:19.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好東西？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:36.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,妝畫得好漂亮喔 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:39.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早啊 你們聚在這幹嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:41.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:48.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了莉露 嘴唇怎麼油亮油亮的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:52.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一大清早就吃肉 會變胖喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:57.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:58.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爛透了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去把你不知道丟在哪裡的\n體貼撿回來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就說我知道錯了嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:11.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為看起來像肉油啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:16.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始要怎樣才會把莉露\n當成女孩子來喜歡？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:22.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這個嘛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,現在這樣的莉露就很好啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:30.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等你長大之後\n一定會變成很棒的女人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:34.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就… 就保持現在這樣就好…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:43.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然用敷衍的話糊弄過去…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:45.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,既然這樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:53.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要變強應該就會覺醒…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:56.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,趕快升級\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:59.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再用魅惑之力操控始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天幹勁十足耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是剛才那句話起作用了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 與其說是幹勁…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:11.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的莉露總覺得有點可怕耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:13.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:19.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,砰？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:28.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很危險耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:38.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快停下來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快停下來啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:48.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不妙了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得脫身才行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,站起來！瞄準那傢伙心臟的位置\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:05.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你平常在分解肉的時候看過吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:15.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我看看…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在這裡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:24.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很行嘛 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:26.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:33.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露滿身都是血耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:37.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幹得好啊 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:41.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姊姊說的也許沒錯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:45.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算用了魅惑之力去操控始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:48.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定也不會有這種心情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:52.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（莉露升級了\n學會了新的魅惑技能）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:09:00.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是學到什麼技能了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:05.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,試個一次應該也可以吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:16.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,血跑進眼睛了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這什麼啊 好厲害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:36.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是魅惑對方的技能嗎…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:40.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然等級差太多就不會生效\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但這也太誇張了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:47.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易學到很像魅魔的技能\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:49.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼只對這些傢伙有效啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,下次一定會成功的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:06.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這次是有髒東西跑進去了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:13.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 這不是莉露想要的效果啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:15.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（“魅惑之鏈”！\n看來對人類沒有效）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:21.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:24.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早安！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:26.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早安啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是鹿神的頭套喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:39.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為祭典快到了 我就先做了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:42.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有祭典嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:46.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,聽說是獻給豐饒大精靈\n鹿神大人的祭典喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:49.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早安 可可\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早安\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:53.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,豐饒… 是什麼意思啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.73,0:10:58.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是食物會收成很多的意思啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典那天還會擺很多攤子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到處都是好吃的喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對了 我們也來擺攤吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就烤我們在迷宮拿到的肉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:14.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想做！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:15.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就這麼決定了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:20.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你們真的很想的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:22.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是不能幫忙啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.51,0:11:25.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就我們三個一起做吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:26.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對對 就是那樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:38.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 別這樣啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:42.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們到底要慢吞吞地\n做到什麼時候啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:44.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你… 你幹嘛啦 羅頓！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:48.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們跟你不一樣\n可是很仔細在做耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:50.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊就是啊！不要來妨礙我們啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,羅頓養的食蟻獸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:58.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很兇暴喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:01.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,住手！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:07.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們幹嘛啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被我的凱薩舔到了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們最好快逃喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為會黏答答的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.21,0:12:37.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,凱薩？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:39.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:44.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等… 住手！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:47.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼舔我啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,凱薩！住手！我叫你住手啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:55.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,全身都濕答答的啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:00.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:04.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你救了我們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沉睡在莉露體內的黑暗之力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,失控了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:13.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好… 好帥！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗之力感覺好棒喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫莉露對吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,鹿神大人的頭套\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們一起做吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:26.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:30.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典的頭套？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:32.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典那天\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,約好大家要一起玩了的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:37.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還有啊 莉露要跟安揚戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一起開賣肉的店！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:40.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,賣肉的店？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是要把在迷宮抓到的肉拿來烤！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:49.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露好期待祭典喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:03.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的店一定生意很好的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:07.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我小時候又是怎樣的呢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:17.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,從巷子縫隙偷看的那些景色…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:20.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那時的我只能看著\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看著那些有趣的一切…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.53,0:14:31.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望… 莉露那傢伙能玩得開心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:45.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,魔獸的氣息？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:54.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在那邊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:55.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.41,0:15:13.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡！為什麼會來這麼多兔熊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！衝進村子裡了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐… 駐村的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:41.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒事… 牠突然越過大門\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,直接衝進來了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:44.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還是第一次發生這種事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:46.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是怎麼回事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:50.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這次換山狼了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚月色真美呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:15:58.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,椅子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:06.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,箭射得真準 真乖啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:09.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝您！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:11.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼椅子會說話啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:17.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來 賞你的 這頭豬！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝您！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再來一發！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:22.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明明都半夜了 還真有精神啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:25.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為快滿月了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,古代種一到這時候就會熱血沸騰\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:33.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哦… 月亮明明還沒那麼圓啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:37.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼“哦”啊… 你這人真是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:39.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你撿到莉露的時候\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:40.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是跟你說明過了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:43.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你可是正在養我的同族\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:44.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給我再用心一點… 真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:46.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦 交給我吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:48.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我走啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:01.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快滿月時就會熱血沸騰嗎…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:27.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剛才有發光吧 魅惑之鏈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:33.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎光臨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:40.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再多烤一點肉…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,氣氛熱起來啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:49.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們也得去抓肉回來才行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:52.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露要大抓特抓！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 安揚戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:59.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我聽說囉 你們要在祭典擺攤？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:02.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們要烤肉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:04.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到時我會去吃喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:06.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等你來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:10.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只有小孩子會很辛苦吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.34,0:18:12.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是有困難我可以幫忙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,隨時跟我說喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:15.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:18.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真期待啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:22.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好想快點開始烤啊 安揚戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:23.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:28.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨天有做什麼夢嗎？\n像是戰鬥之類的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.73,0:18:31.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有夢到啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:36.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你該不會連操控\n夢境的力量也用了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:38.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有用啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天睡得可香了的說！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊 那就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,往那邊去了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:18.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-眉頭都皺起來了喔\n-所以啊 如果弄出各種形狀的肉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:24.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-有什麼煩惱嗎？\n-我覺得應該會很有趣的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:26.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:28.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 最近半夜\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:31.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,魔獸不是老是闖進來嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:32.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想這件事…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:34.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每晚都辛苦了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:38.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為搞不清楚原因\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家看起來都很不安…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是棘手啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:48.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把可可也叫來\n在我家開作戰會議吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要開要開！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:52.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,說得也是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:55.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對村子來說 這確實很麻煩啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.28,0:19:59.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個？東雲先生？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:04.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒事 沒什麼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:21.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露… 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:32.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的手臂在發光！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:36.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個光 你能讓它停下來嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:44.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看來不行的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:49.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼莉露的手臂會發光啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.41,0:20:52.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:56.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,被封印的力量！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:59.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,封印在你體內的黑暗之力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:01.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正要覺醒了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:03.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:07.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這下不得了了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:11.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到莉露體內的黑暗之龍\n竟然真的要甦醒了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你還真喜歡龍啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:18.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,既然變成這樣就沒辦法了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:23.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那莉露就要用這股力量…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:26.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來幫助村裡的大家！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:33.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 這個力量得保密\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:36.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:42.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,叫做秘密力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:44.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是比較帥嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:46.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也對！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:49.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那你快去睡吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:53.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我還有一點剩下的工作要做\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 故鄉與同伴）\n
